WEBVTT

01:07:58.579 --> 01:08:02.496
OK, that's it for today. You can
read more about open eyes,

01:08:02.496 --> 01:08:06.163
vision and progress at open eye dotcom.

01:08:06.913 --> 01:08:11.329
If you want to try playing with yourself,
it's a little tricky.

01:08:11.329 --> 01:08:14.538
You have to find a website that
has licensed the API.

01:08:14.871 --> 01:08:19.246
The one I went to was philosopher
ehi dot com,

01:08:19.746 --> 01:08:24.246
where you just you pay a few dollars to
get access to a very strange mind.

01:08:24.538 --> 01:08:25.746
That's actually quite a lot of fun.

01:08:26.579 --> 01:08:29.746
The interview is part of the
TED Audio Collective,

01:08:29.871 --> 01:08:33.704
a collection of podcasts dedicated
to sparking curiosity